# 1354.346, its mcl-stop for the DAC's restart at 1276.515 and 1501.576. Not in this log (the pin trace is card-only,
# dmesg had rolled past): the ID's low, put 6.0 s before each otg-on (V205i's settle) [I]; 1-1's add, put 0.56 s
# after otg-on as measured on 2026-11-23 [E]; the PCM's add, put just before stock's restart [I]; the second
# removal, put at its mcl-stop [I].
